    {
      "id": "claim_30f9646435014924aa5097841c7ffc62",
      "statement": "Label and label-artist links are app-owned entities: because Spotify's `label` field appears only on the full album object (GET /albums/{id}) and not on simplified search/discography items, a followed label is a `labels` row with a derived unique slug, one or more artist anchors linked through `label_artists` (a label must keep at least one artist), and releases discovered separately by the poller; the album's real `label` field is used only as the source of truth for release membership, never as the label's identity.",
