      "id": "claim_9c3d841ef6f64d3a922e1b413917a817",
      "statement": "A discovery candidate that cannot be verified (the full-album GET fails or the album reports no label) is skipped and never upserted, leaving any existing link untouched; the verified-mismatch path is the only deletion of a label_albums row during polling, so a transient search miss never removes a legitimately discovered release and links created before exact verification existed self-heal on the next pass.",
